+            <t indent="0" pn="section-4.1-6.1.2">The only transformation from an EUI-64 identifier is to invert the &quot;u&quot; bit (universal/local bit in IEEE EUI-64 terminology). For example, for a globally unique EUI-64 identifier of the form:</t>
+          </li>
